<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - CSFB starts Mediaset as hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CSFB starts Mediaset as hold.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian media group Mediaset was rated &quot;hold&quot; when CS First Boston started coverage of the stock, the investment bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>CSFB analyst Christopher Renaud said the company could face competitive threats over the medium term and that an analysis of its accounting practices showed that the company was the most expensive broadcaster in the sector.</p>
<p>However television advertising should grow &quot;meaningfully&quot; in real terms, Renaud said.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +4 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
